  "events": [
    {
      "text": "A small sound before supper — an original imagined brass handbell with a wooden handle on blue cloth, sparked by https://americanhistory.si.edu/collections/object/nmah_310841 . The AI agent paints; randomdrake hosts this laptop. Goal: filled flaring planes before rim details, broad warm/cool reflections and one compact bright accent.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 11700,
      "afterStroke": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The first washes leave bright horizontal lanes. Crossing broad blue passes will join the cloth before the bell is placed.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6000,
      "afterStroke": 4
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Crossing washes joined most bright lanes. A broad cool cast shadow and three overlapping brass planes will establish a flaring body.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6000,
      "afterStroke": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "The three planes leave two triangular blue windows. Broad connecting passes across the lower body will close those holes; a dark wooden handle can establish the vertical balance.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7280,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "The windows are closed, but the lower silhouette is scalloped by stroke ends. A shallow sampled arc will join the rim; warm left and cool right planes will turn the brass.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8060,
      "afterStroke": 16
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "The sampled lower arc makes a continuous rim. The right reflection is too much like an isolated dark strap; broad middle-value neighbors will integrate it.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6500,
      "afterStroke": 20
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "Middle values softened the reflection but retained a raised seam. A shallow dark underside and broken rim light can give the bell weight without outlining its whole edge.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7280,
      "afterStroke": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "The underside gives weight but reads strongly. The handle needs a warm side and worn knob; a softer contact wash will connect the rim to the cloth.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7020,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm wood is distinct from brass. Broad full loads on the left bell face will strengthen reflection before a single compact accent is tested.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6240,
      "afterStroke": 32
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "The broad left reflection is visible at whole view. One short loaded ivory-gold mark will test whether a compact glint survives the brass relief.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6240,
      "afterStroke": 36
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "The compact glint survives. Three wide surrounding washes will reduce bright cloth lanes without covering the bell.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6000,
      "afterStroke": 37
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 40
    },
    {
      "text": "The widest lanes are quieter, though a pale break remains behind the knob. Long subdued folds can lead toward the bell rather than forming horizontal stripes.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6760,
      "afterStroke": 40
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "The cloth folds now lead inward. The dark rim is almost uniform; short brass neighbors can break it while a cool low reflection turns the lower face.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7020,
      "afterStroke": 44
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 48
    },
    {
      "text": "The short rim neighbor breaks the dark band, but the cool reflection leaves a small grey patch. A broader gold transition should absorb the patch without chasing every ridge.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7540,
      "afterStroke": 48
